* xspice_r3_sxfer -- card #557 fixture: the R3 voltage-mode buck (tests/fixtures/pac_r3_ctrl2out.cir) with its type-III op-amp compensator
* (Goa/Roa/Coa + R1in R3in C3in C1f R2f C2f) replaced by an XSPICE s_xfer, C(s) = K (1+s/wz)^2 / (s (1+s/wp)), K=1e5, wz=2pi 5 kHz, wp=2pi 200 kHz
* (loop crossover ~30 kHz, regulates 3.3 V; a stateful analog code model in a switching loop).  Vctrl (AC 1) is the series injection between the
* compensator output and the comparator, as in the R3 fixtures: control-to-output.  tests/test_xspice.py appends `.options` and `.pac`.
.param vin_v=12 fs=500k tclk={1/fs}
.param lval=10u rdcr=10m cval=100u esrval=10m rload=3.3
.param ra=2300 rb=1000 vref=1
.param r1=10k r2=27.51k r3=101.7 c1=36.35p c2=2.299n c3=6.261n
.param vramp=2
.param gm_oa=1000 ro_oa=100 co_oa=100p
.param gon=100 goff=1e-6 ksw=30 kc=30

Vin vin 0 DC {vin_v}

Bhs vin sw I = (V(vin)-V(sw)) * ({goff}+({gon}-{goff})*0.5*(1+tanh({ksw}*(V(pwm)-0.5))))
Bls sw 0   I = V(sw)              * ({goff}+({gon}-{goff})*0.5*(1+tanh({ksw}*(0.5-V(pwm)))))

Csw sw 0 100p
L1 sw swl {lval} IC=0
Rdcr swl vout {rdcr}
Resr vout cx {esrval}
Cout cx 0 {cval} IC=0
Rload vout 0 {rload}

Vprobe fbtop vout DC 0
Ra fbtop fbnode {ra}
Rb fbnode 0 {rb}

Vrefsrc vrefnode 0 DC {vref}


Vramp ramp 0 PULSE(0 {vramp} 0 {0.97*tclk} {0.03*tclk} 1n {tclk})
Vctrl ctrlnode opout DC 0 AC 1
Bcmp pwm 0 V = 0.5*(1+tanh({kc}*(V(ctrlnode)-V(ramp))))


A0 [vrefnode fbnode] e1 sm
.model sm summer(in_gain=[1 -1])
A1 e1 opout mc
.model mc s_xfer(gain=100000.0 num_coeff=[1.013211836e-09 6.366197724e-05 1] den_coeff=[7.957747155e-07 1 0] int_ic=[0 0])
Rop opout 0 1meg
